      "id": "sol.amc-10-2000-p9.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Because \\(x \\lt 2,\\) we have \\(|x - 2| = 2 - x = p,\\) so \\(x = 2 - p.\\)\n\nThen \\[x - p = (2 - p) - p = 2 - 2p.\\]\n\nThus, the correct answer is C.",
